<div class="sedna-col sedna-gap-3">
    <div class="sedna-split sedna-split--stack-md sedna-split--sticky sedna-split--aside-first">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-head"><h3>Order summary</h3></div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <p>Four lines, two shipped. The rest leave the warehouse with the next run.</p>
                <p>On a narrow screen the totals come first; side by side they stay in view while this column scrolls.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="card sedna-split-aside">
            <div class="card-head"><strong>Totals</strong></div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <div class="kv"><span class="k">Net</span><span class="v">1,240.00</span></div>
                <div class="kv"><span class="k">Tax</span><span class="v">235.60</span></div>
            </div>
        </aside>
    </div>
    <div class="sedna-split sedna-split--stack-lg">
        <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><strong>Runbook</strong></div><div class="card-body"><p>Side by side only from 1200 pixels of the split's own width.</p></div></div>
        <aside class="card sedna-split-aside"><div class="card-head"><strong>Contacts</strong></div><div class="card-body"><p>Alex Fischer, on call.</p></div></aside>
    </div>
    <div class="sedna-split sedna-split--even">
        <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><strong>Before</strong></div><div class="card-body"><p>Retry after 30 seconds.</p></div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><strong>After</strong></div><div class="card-body"><p>Retry after 5, 15 and 45 seconds.</p></div></div>
    </div>
</div>
